CORE
main.c
--memory-leak-check --pointer-check --graphml-witness -
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
<data key="assumption">p = ((signed int \*)0);</data>
--
<data key="assumption">malloc_size
<data key="assumption">ptr =
<data key="assumption">e =
--
A validator cannot read assumptions about the locals of library functions
(malloc_size in malloc, ptr in free) or about values set before main by
__CPROVER_initialize; the witness keeps only the program's own (upstream CBMC
1b78fa1fc8, issue #5264).
